    description: "The QMBL paper"
abstract: >-
  A live record of the best published variational ground-state energies for lattice
  Hamiltonians, ranked by energy, with an explicit bound_type on every row that says
  whether the number is variational, projected, extrapolated or exact. Each row
  cites the primary paper that produced the number. The starting set of references was
  bootstrapped from the VarBench compilation (Wu et al., Science 386, 296 (2024)),
  Apache-2.0, which is credited as a source of references, not as a parent work.
